6" y1="1584" x2="1944" y2="1584" data-start="post_outcome" data-end="post_status" data-start-side="right" data-end-side="left" data-shape="straight" data-arrow="end" stroke="#313131" stroke-width="2"/><line id="post_edge11" x1="2432" y1="1584" x2="2560" y2="1584" data-start="post_status" data-end="post_notify" data-start-side="right" data-end-side="left" data-shape="straight" data-arrow="end" stroke="#313131" stroke-width="2"/><textArea id="post_text0" x="64" y="1856" width="3072" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#595959">Conditional flow: cancellation acceptance proceeds to eligibility. Pending outcomes reconcile; rejected requests follow the return policy.</textArea><textArea id="post_text1" x="64" y="1952" width="3072" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#595959">Customer calls to cancellation/refund execution APIs are forbidden. Opening a support case never automatically cancels.</textArea><textArea id="post_text2" x="64" y="2048" width="3072" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#595959">Refunds are bounded by captured money and existing refund intents. Notification failures never undo the order.</textArea></g></svg>